# Build context for server/Dockerfile (the game-room image). A second guard
# behind the Dockerfile's COPY allowlist: exclude everything, re-include only
# the allowlist, then drop secrets and every .pak. The context holds no game
# data: the Dockerfile fetches LibreQuake itself. Registered and rerelease data
# must never reach an image. tools/check_container_image.sh (CI) checks this.
*
!deno.json
!deno.lock
!server/
!src/
!tools/
tools/*
!tools/fetch_data.js

# TLS files and env files, even inside the allowlisted directories
# (server/README.md generates server/cert.pem and server/key.pem).
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Any pak, in any case, anywhere.
**/*.[pP][aA][kK]
